invariant: INV-16
file: widemul.h
catches: widemul_runtime_test
reason: widemul_native runs the native copies for every byte but
  CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, so a direction whose answer was never written, 0,
  runs the native multiply on its key. The init calls refuse such bytes,
  and the dispatchers must not depend on that (widemul.h).
  bin/widemul_runtime_test runs every operation under 0, 3, 0x80 and 0xff
  and requires the decomposition.

--- old
    return widemul == CH_WIDEMUL_CONSTANT_TIME;
--- new
    return widemul != CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED;
